1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,250
Lacquer begins as tree sap.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:08,250
A brush lays it on, thin as breath.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:12,417
Each coat waits for damp air to cure.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,617
Polished smooth, again, thirty times.

5
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,117
Cut one open. Every coat is still there.

6
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:25,217
Nothing happens. That is the work.

7
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:28,817
Only now, the gold.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,917
One line, drawn once. Then powder.

9
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:37,517
Each stroke rests on every coat beneath.

10
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:42,250
Turn it, and the light goes deep.

11
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:48,117
Now, open it.

12
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,050
Months of waiting, held in one hand.
